Documented deviations from upstream
-----------------------------------

The management API at /management/* is plain REST/JSON gated by an
"Authorization: Bearer <KEY>" header, where upstream serves an oRPC
surface at /management-api/* gated by an "x-api-key" header. Same
underlying capability, smaller HTTP surface. See README.md.
